Subject: [PATCH 2/7] ASoC: stm32: i2s: fix 16 bit format support
Date:   Tue, 26 Feb 2019 14:51:05 +0100
Message-ID: <1551189070-15469-3-git-send-email-olivier.moysan@st.com>
